  <p class=MsoNormal>Hussain hussain hussain ya hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Hayya ala khairil amal</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Hussain hussain hussain ya hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal><span style=mso-spacerun:yes>&nbsp;</span>Ya Hussain, Ya hussain</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Farzand-e-zahra aba abdillah, sada de rahe hai maqtal se..</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Tumhe rasool ki beti ka salaam</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Har jagah majlise bapa karna</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Karbala walo se wafa karna</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Zindagi waqf-e-karbala karna</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Sunnat-e-zainab-o-sajjad nibhane keliye</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>chalo chalo, Chalo chalo ke jaha farsh-e-aza lejaye, chalo chalo..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Husaini fikr ko zinda rakho badhao qadam</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Nazar me rakho alamdar-e-karbala ka haram..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Kaisi qismat kaha ki taqdeerein</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Chodkar dehr ki ye jageerein</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Tod kar waqt ki ye zanjeerein</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Apne bachho ko alamdaar banana ke liye</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>chalo chalo, Chalo chalo ke jaha farsh-e-aza lejaye, chalo chalo..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>zamee se arsh-e-moalla ka faasla hai bohot</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>magar husaini qabeele ka hausla hai bohot..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>bint-e-zehra pe bharosa to karo..</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>apni takhleeq pe socha to karo</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>saath wo dengi iraada to karo</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>chaand par parcham-e-abbas lagane ke liye</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>chalo chalo, Chalo chalo ke jaha farsh-e-aza lejaye, chalo chalo..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>jahan hussain nahi ho wo koi ghar to nahi</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal><span style=mso-spacerun:yes>&nbsp;</span>qasam hussain ki ye kaam bhi mushkil to nahi..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>marefat kya hai batane ke liye..</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>roz meraaj pe jaane ke liye</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>uski tauqeer badhane ke liye</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>hauz-e-kausar pe in ashko ko milane ke liye</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>chalo chalo, Chalo chalo ke jaha farsh-e-aza lejaye, chalo chalo..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>arsh ho khuld ho kausain ya karbal ki zamee</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>tum azadaar ho tum par koi pabandi nahi..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>haisiyat apni khudara samjho..</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>ye bhi zehra ki hai ata samjho</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>kya hai ye zikr-e-karbala samjho</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>saari duniya ko azakhana banana ke liye</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>chalo chalo, Chalo chalo ke jaha farsh-e-aza lejaye, chalo chalo..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>shahe dilgeer ki hamsheer ka matam na ruke</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>saans ruk jaye ye shabbir ka matam na ruke..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>duniya walo ne isko kya jaana..</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>kya hai shabbir ka ye afsana</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>qaid khana ho ya azakhana</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>maqsad-e-hazrat-e-shabbir bachane ke liye</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>chalo chalo, Chalo chalo ke jaha farsh-e-aza lejaye, chalo chalo..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>ek halqa ho azadaro baraye matam</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>hai isi baat me poshida baqae matam..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>sabke seeno me ho tazeem-e-aza..</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>hone dena nahi taqseem-e-aza</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>haan ise kehte hai tanzeem-e-aza</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>halqa-e-matam-e-shabbir badhane ke liye</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>chalo chalo, Chalo chalo ke jaha farsh-e-aza lejaye, chalo chalo..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>kya kabhi bhool sake shaam-e-ghareeba ka dhua</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>dast-e-shabbir pe asghar to kabhi laashe jawaa..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>gunji maqtal me ye zainab ki sadaa..</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>roke ye khaak nasheeno se kaha</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>rahe koofa ho ke bazaar-e-jafa</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>mere mazloom ka paighaam sunane ke liye</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>chalo chalo, Chalo chalo ke jaha farsh-e-aza lejaye, chalo chalo..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>jab mila hukm-e-rehai to ye zainab ne kaha</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>qaidiyo aao kare matam-e-shabbir bapa</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>aao fizza padho hadis-e-kisa</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>marsiya tum padho kulsoom zara</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>zakiri tumkaro ae zainul eba</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>aisa matam ho mere bhai ka</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>gunj uthi mazhar-o-irfan sadaa..</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>khuld se aagai hai maa zehra</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>nauha sunne ko mere baqer ka</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>ya abbasa hussaina..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>ya mazlooma hussaina</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>ya asghara hussaina</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>ya akbara hussaina</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>ya qasima hussaina</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>ya zainaba hussaina</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>ya sakina hussaina</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>ya aliya hussaina</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>ya fatema hussaina</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Hussain hussain..</p>
